# GuitarFreaks Ver 1.01 (GQ886 VER. JAD): the first power-on. The game asks "DO YOU WANT TO
# INITIALIZE FLASH-ROM?" (by frame ~300); Test answers yes, the CD is copied to the onboard flash,
# and "FLASH-ROM INITIALIZE COMPLETE, please press test button" shows by frame ~10200. Hashes the
# main RAM every frame and snapshots every 60 frames, to compare with MAME.
game gtrfrksj

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

at 600 press "Service Mode" 8
from 0 every 60 snap
at 11000 quit
